  "title": "Enforce -Wpointer-sign, and thus -Wall -Wextra, everywhere",
  "description": "The ASN.1 dissectors were the last to be converted, and -Wpointer-sign\nwas the last of the GCC and Clang -Wall -Wextra exceptions. Get rid\nof the exception.\n\nFix #20175\n\nWe might still want to follow up by converting some types used by\nsome of the API functions, or providing extra functions for PER\nand BER VAL_PTRs of different signedness, to avoid explicit casts,\nwhich can be error-prone in the face of typos.",
